messages "Wicked**Subj: clerruDate: Mar 16cast chl bls mar at target = manacast chl bls les at target = hpcast chl bls min at target = regencast chl eth min at target = resscast chl eth les at target = reinccast chl xfr min at target = harm body smallcast chl xfr mar at target = harm body largecast chl hea min at target = curecast chl hea mar at target = large curecast chl hea les at target = distand healcast chl num les at target = cure poisoncast chl num min at target = cure diseasecast chl num mar at target = remove scar**Proge**Subj: ANGLIA-logoDate: Mar 16	 ___  ____  ___  _    _  ___	´   `´  | `´  _`´ `  ´ `´   `	| | ||  | || |_ | |  | || | |	|   || |  || | || |_ | ||   |	._|_.._|__..___..___.._.._|_.**Proge**Subj: elementalDate: Mar 17You give pouch to Elemental.As you give the pouch to the elemental, he momentarily shines up with a smileand as he shakes his head he exclaims:'You are surely worthy the _name_!''The name of the planes of earth is 'strakhad'.You receive 5 quest points.**Tharclax**Subj: JuupDate: Apr 27/echo x,y = hea mar  gives True Healing %/echo x,y = bls min  gives Regeneration %/echo x,y = bls les  gives Durability %/echo x,y = bls mar  gives More Mana %/echo x,y = num min  gives %/echo x,y = num les  gives Remove Poison %/echo x,y = num mar  gives Remove Scar %/echo x,y = eth min  gives Resurrection %/echo x,y = eth les  gives Reincarnation %/echo x,y = eth mar  gives Resurrection %/echo x,y = xfr min  gives Drain Health (140 hp) %/echo x,y = xfr les  gives Transfer Health %/echo x,y = xfr mar  gives Harm (140 hp)       **Drude**Subj: guilds (additional)Cc: DrudeDate: May  3The Weaponmaster guild (10 levels) trains the following stats:Str: some       Dex: some       Con: a littleInt: a little   Wis: a little+-----------------------+-----------+-----------+-----------+-----------+|Skill:                 |  Current  |Training to|  Maximum  |Skill 